WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.142 --> 00:00:01.125
- If I went trick-or-treating,

00:00:01.125 --> 00:00:02.146
and someone put this in my bag,

00:00:02.146 --> 00:00:03.706
I'd come back and egg their house.

00:00:03.706 --> 00:00:06.789
(midtempo pop music)

00:00:12.802 --> 00:00:15.264
- I'm Australian, so I've
never actually had candy corn.

00:00:15.264 --> 00:00:17.055
I've only seen it in movies.

00:00:17.055 --> 00:00:17.888
- Hate it.

00:00:17.888 --> 00:00:19.056
I think it just tastes horrible.

00:00:19.056 --> 00:00:22.055
It's like corn syrup and stripping paint.

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:25.128
- I think one of the best
things about it becoming fall

00:00:25.128 --> 00:00:27.085
is that it's appropriate

00:00:27.085 --> 00:00:29.110
to buy candy corn without judgement.

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:30.357
- I think there's probably
a good intersection

00:00:30.357 --> 00:00:31.559
between people who love candy corn

00:00:31.559 --> 00:00:32.630
and people who love brunch.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:36.096
- (laughs) Yeah.

00:00:36.096 --> 00:00:38.998
The texture already looks
a little weird for me.

00:00:38.998 --> 00:00:40.000
Oh.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.037
- It's syrupy.

00:00:41.037 --> 00:00:42.600
- You move it like this.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.966
That's how you make it a
tooth, like a snaggletooth.

00:00:45.966 --> 00:00:46.799
- Cheers, Chloe.

00:00:46.799 --> 00:00:48.695
- Cheers. (laughs)

00:00:48.695 --> 00:00:52.101
- It's chalky, a, that's not
the normal candy corn texture.

00:00:52.101 --> 00:00:53.841
- Where's the chocolate?

00:00:53.841 --> 00:00:54.871
- There's none.

00:00:54.871 --> 00:00:57.221
- Tastes like pancake
batter really strongly,

00:00:57.221 --> 00:00:58.843
with a little chocolate aftertaste.

00:00:58.843 --> 00:01:01.067
- At first I really tasted the chocolate

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:02.811
and the pancake batter kind of vibe,

00:01:02.811 --> 00:01:04.467
but then, when you mentioned.

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:06.238
- When the syrup came in, it ruined it!

00:01:06.238 --> 00:01:08.252
- It kind of tastes like if you were

00:01:08.252 --> 00:01:09.524
to finish a plate of pancakes,

00:01:09.524 --> 00:01:13.575
leave the plate for like an
hour, come back and lick it,

00:01:13.575 --> 00:01:18.573
it's a little bit like what
it tastes like. (laughs)

00:01:18.573 --> 00:01:21.174
- Fake fruit flavor is always a hard one.

00:01:21.174 --> 00:01:22.495
Are you just eating it all at once?

00:01:22.495 --> 00:01:23.586
- Yeah.

00:01:23.586 --> 00:01:24.419
Whoa!

00:01:24.419 --> 00:01:27.130
- It was very, that
sugary strawberry flavor

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:30.359
where it's not really tasting
like a strawberry at all.

00:01:30.359 --> 00:01:31.842
- It's just such a weird aftertaste,

00:01:31.842 --> 00:01:33.655
like I just wanna take my tongue out

00:01:33.655 --> 00:01:35.417
and rub it on the carpet or something.

00:01:35.417 --> 00:01:37.812
- The first taste immediately
is fake strawberry,

00:01:37.812 --> 00:01:40.389
almost like medicine, but the good kind,

00:01:40.389 --> 00:01:42.086
like that pink one you'd
have when you were a kid.

00:01:42.086 --> 00:01:45.499
However, after two seconds,
it really turns into a waffle.

00:01:45.499 --> 00:01:46.611
That was crazy.

00:01:46.611 --> 00:01:48.611
- I like this one a lot.

00:01:51.317 --> 00:01:55.021
- They all smell a little
bit like cleaning solution.

00:01:55.021 --> 00:01:55.927
- Whoa.

00:01:55.927 --> 00:01:59.199
(uncertain giggles)

00:01:59.199 --> 00:02:02.784
- That tastes nothing
like (bleep) french toast.

00:02:02.784 --> 00:02:05.206
- This is actually the
least intense flavor.

00:02:05.206 --> 00:02:08.755
It kind of just tastes
like buttery sweet bread.

00:02:08.755 --> 00:02:09.622
- I love it.

00:02:09.622 --> 00:02:10.690
- It's actually really good.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:12.870
It tastes like butter,
that's why I like it.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:13.703
I love butter.

00:02:13.703 --> 00:02:15.258
- That was crazy!

00:02:15.258 --> 00:02:16.744
What a subtle flavor.

00:02:16.744 --> 00:02:17.813
What a subtle, beautiful

00:02:17.813 --> 00:02:19.849
- I'm immediately going
back for another handful.

00:02:19.849 --> 00:02:22.067
- Yeah, not even one, a handful.

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:23.317
- I'm on board.

00:02:26.475 --> 00:02:29.394
- Would you have any of
these over a classic corn?

00:02:29.394 --> 00:02:30.227
- No.

00:02:30.227 --> 00:02:31.060
- No way.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:32.216
- Candy corn should stay candy corn.

00:02:32.216 --> 00:02:34.488
I don't think we should
go beyond those borders.

00:02:34.488 --> 00:02:36.610
- I just feel like with any meal or lolly,

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:38.766
if you're gonna eat it, it might
as well be worth it, right?

00:02:38.766 --> 00:02:41.600
'Cause it's not great for you, these.

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:43.254
Neither is brunch most of the time,

00:02:43.254 --> 00:02:44.830
so it better be good.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.247
- Candy corn's already hard to binge on,

00:02:46.247 --> 00:02:47.230
this is even harder to binge on

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:48.063
- Yeah.

00:02:48.063 --> 00:02:48.896
- Than normal candy corn.

00:02:48.896 --> 00:02:49.729
- Yeah.

00:02:49.729 --> 00:02:51.499
- Um, I mean.

00:02:51.499 --> 00:02:52.813
- Why did I just eat another one? (laughs)

00:02:52.813 --> 00:02:54.417
- Why do you want that?

00:02:54.417 --> 00:02:55.904
- I was just sitting here!

00:02:55.904 --> 00:02:56.737
Oh!

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.370
(sign squeaks)

